  ($qb$ITEM-FIB-25PLUS-432$qb$, $qb$A4-05$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$Current results are strong, but the operating model may be building risks that will become visible only after several planning cycles. The immediate message should not hide a risk simply because its consequence lies beyond the current reporting period. When a message needs action, stating the required ______ clearly reduces back-and-forth.$qb$, $qb$action$qb$, $qb$response$qb$, $qb$task$qb$, $qb$thought$qb$, $qb$reaction$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
