  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-0TO2-R6-008$qb$, $qb$A4-01$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$You strongly supported a plan, but new information shows another approach is better. What should you do?$qb$, $qb$Acknowledge the new evidence and support the better approach$qb$, $qb$Review the new information and explain why you are changing your view$qb$, $qb$Continue defending your plan until a manager decides$qb$, $qb$Suggest combining both approaches to avoid admitting a change$qb$, $qb$Ignore the new information$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
