  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-0TO2-R7-007$qb$, $qb$A4-03$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$A team social activity always happens at a time one colleague cannot attend because of a regular commitment. What is the best approach?$qb$, $qb$Discuss alternative times or formats so participation is reasonably accessible$qb$, $qb$Ask the colleague which other times could work$qb$, $qb$Keep the usual time but send them photos afterward$qb$, $qb$Tell them attendance is optional$qb$, $qb$Exclude them from future planning because they cannot attend$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
